OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to fund alley garden after
OL,4,Aclearance mix up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it will fund a new
OL,7,Fcommunity alley garden after workers
OL,8,Fripped it out by mistake.
OL,10,FManchester City Council apologised and
OL,11,Fsaid contractors had been responding to
OL,12,Fa report of overgrown vegetation, but
OL,13,Finstead had destroyed the intentional
OL,14,Fplanting, trellises and wildlife
OL,15,Fhabitats in the passageway.
OL,17,FIt blamed an "inexcusable breakdown in
OL,18,Fcommunication and on-site judgement"
OL,19,Ffor the clearance.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
