OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to fund alley garden after
OL,4,Aclearance mix up
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Marrett, who helped establish the
OL,7,Foriginal garden in the Levenshulme area
OL,8,Fof Manchester, said it was a "relief"
OL,9,Fthe mistake had been acknowledged, and
OL,10,Fwhile "you can't build a garden
OL,11,Fovernight" he hoped more people from
OL,12,Fthe community would get involved in the
OL,13,Frestoration.
